          "rhyme": "e",
          "persona_id": "persona_dr_tc"
        },
        {
          "n": "2",
          "text": "But, I just brought all your friends here to talk to you",
          "rhyme": "u",
          "persona_id": "persona_dr_tc"
        },
        {
          "n": "3",
          "text": "Because they're, they're really worried 'bout you",
          "rhyme": "u",
