        {
          "n": "9",
          "text": "That could pay the whole fucking city's mortgage",
          "rhyme": "aZ",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "10",
          "text": "Hopefully, I make a lot of porridge from tourin' in fucking Oregon",
          "rhyme": "$",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "11",
          "text": "From playing piano organs and hopefully, I can pay the bill",
          "rhyme": "il",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "12",
          "text": "Shit is getting real, people begin to feel",
          "rhyme": "El",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baseline"
