          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "14",
          "text": "About some shit, they bitch and pout",
          "rhyme": "ut",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "15",
          "text": "\"Can we get backstage, man?\" — No, faggot, it's sold out",
          "rhyme": "awt",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "16",
          "text": "\"Come on, why you holding out? I thought we was boys",
          "rhyme": "Oj",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "17",
