          "text": "\"Here's some 'Give a Fuck' cake\" — Oh, maybe I should have some",
          "rhyme": "om",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "6",
          "text": "\"Asshole, have none\"",
          "rhyme": "On",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "7",
          "text": "How can I wake up on the wrong side of the bed, when I don't even fucking have one?",
          "rhyme": "On",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "8",
          "text": "(\"Shit, I don't know\")",
          "rhyme": null,
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "9",
          "text": "And when I'm on that stage, I feel important",
